{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John! Long time no see! What's up?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-542938f0b58dbcd4abdea4b6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.203101+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "542938f0b58dbcd4abdea4b6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "542938f0b58dbcd4abdea4b6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Maria! Good to see you. Just got back from a family road trip yesterday, it was fun! Anything exciting happening for you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-8a2eb8f533682c8827647c33", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.227261+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8a2eb8f533682c8827647c33", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8a2eb8f533682c8827647c33", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Been busy volunteering at the homeless shelter and keeping fit. Just started doing aerial yoga, it's great. Have you tried any other cool workout classes?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-a82cfab19b16d5bde38b046e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.244833+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a82cfab19b16d5bde38b046e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a82cfab19b16d5bde38b046e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Woah, Maria, that sounds cool! I'm doing kickboxing and it's giving me so much energy."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-619bc659acda001f6f0a4701", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.259897+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "619bc659acda001f6f0a4701", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "619bc659acda001f6f0a4701", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Cool, John. Kickboxing is a perfect way to stay in shape and de-stress. Do you have any goals you're working towards?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-2c8e766483310495f8fca273", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.279815+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2c8e766483310495f8fca273", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2c8e766483310495f8fca273", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah Maria, I'm really hoping to get into local politics. I love helping the community and making it a better place."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-20a322a04ce854abd0476ae1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.296755+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "20a322a04ce854abd0476ae1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "20a322a04ce854abd0476ae1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Woohoo, John! That's awesome! Any specific areas you want to tackle?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-5ba40cb131d49fb9c2326126", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.312201+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5ba40cb131d49fb9c2326126", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5ba40cb131d49fb9c2326126", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I'm passionate about improving education and infrastructure in our community. Those are my main focuses."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-1ac7fc69571388805cd7445f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.326050+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1ac7fc69571388805cd7445f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1ac7fc69571388805cd7445f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John! It's great to hear that. Could you tell me what got you interested in those topics?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-a6d298e7e8de58d68afccc36", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.343057+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a6d298e7e8de58d68afccc36", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a6d298e7e8de58d68afccc36", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Growing up, I saw how lack of education and crumbling infrastructure affected my neighborhood. I don't want future generations to go through that, so I think schools and infrastructure should be funded properly. Here's a pic of a school last year, after they got the funding."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-a9ceb506cf54bdb47df736bc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.361450+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a9ceb506cf54bdb47df736bc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a9ceb506cf54bdb47df736bc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Looks good! How did the extra funding help with building the school?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-72a17eaacb1d2a9a91ddea0e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.382943+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "72a17eaacb1d2a9a91ddea0e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "72a17eaacb1d2a9a91ddea0e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: It enabled needed repairs and renovations, making the learning environment safer and more modern for students."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-e306232987de4a7ea9cb2acd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.400572+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e306232987de4a7ea9cb2acd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e306232987de4a7ea9cb2acd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow John, it really made a difference for schools and students! It must have been great to be involved. What's your next move in politics?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-a52e7100ecede331f544d7c6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.419144+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a52e7100ecede331f544d7c6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a52e7100ecede331f544d7c6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I'm gonna chat with local leaders and organizations, get support and gather ideas for my next move."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-13337d469f6d13be83572502", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.439122+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "13337d469f6d13be83572502", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "13337d469f6d13be83572502", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Sounds good, John. Let's get support and great ideas from local leaders and organizations. Keep me posted on how your campaign is going."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-20f9652191c9edf4c7033931", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.456308+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "20f9652191c9edf4c7033931", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "20f9652191c9edf4c7033931", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Got it! Thanks, Maria. I definitely will."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_1-2081aa77c3f1ef0860724d8d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:31:10.474755+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2081aa77c3f1ef0860724d8d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2081aa77c3f1ef0860724d8d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
